From 38ac1bd4c866117f2dd94784cb2d012a8a4d98d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:08:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: rootless-docker CI lane on hermes-hub (docker-ci
 runners), skip mac/Windows, non-fatal artifact uploads [daveey] (#18)

* ci: route docker jobs to rootless-docker runners, skip mac/Windows lanes, non-fatal artifact uploads [daveey]

* ci: docker lane on dedicated docker-ci runners (no hermes-hub label overlap); run amd64 image builds on the fork, drop arm64 legs [daveey]

* ci(fork): artifact continue-on-error insert is step-aware (no duplicate keys -> workflow file errors) [daveey]

* ci: retrigger docker/nix lanes [daveey]

* ci(fork): tests/ci reports tests-os/desktop_updater lane assertions as fork skips (lane off, no mac/Windows runner) [daveey]

* ci(fork): docker.yml amd64 build timeout 120 min on the shared hub runner [daveey]
